  "title": "日常漫步 Vol.27 之漫步日常",
  "summary": "山山水水，郁郁葱葱。走走停停，晃晃悠悠。朝朝暮暮，平平淡淡。日常的漫步，漫步的日常。爬山，戏水，养鱼，看花，恍 […]",
  "content": "<p>山山水水，郁郁葱葱。走走停停，晃晃悠悠。朝朝暮暮，平平淡淡。日常的漫步，漫步的日常。爬山，戏水，养鱼，看花，恍恍惚惚又是一个月。又到一年冲刺阶段，工作日有多忙，周末就想多散漫。忙为生计，闲以养心，心有清宁，不问匆匆。不追流光，不扰清欢。若无闲事挂心头，便是人间好时节。</p>\n\n<img width=\"1500\" height=\"1125\" src=\"https://yayu.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026112414470046.webp\" alt=\"\">\n<img width=\"1500\" height=\"1125\" src=\"https://yayu.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026112414470233.webp\" alt=\"\">\n<img width=\"1500\" height=\"1139\" src=\"https://yayu.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026112414470231.webp\" alt=\"\">\n<img width=\"1500\" height=\"1125\" src=\"https://yayu.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026112414470150.webp\" alt=\"\">\n\n\n<img width=\"1500\" height=\"1125\" src=\"https://yayu.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026112414470292.webp\" alt=\"\">\n<img width=\"1500\" height=\"1125\" src=\"https://yayu.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/202611241447035.webp\" alt=\"\">\n<img width=\"1500\" height=\"1125\" src=\"https://yayu.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026112414470330.webp\" alt=\"\">\n<img width=\"1500\" height=\"1125\" src=\"https://yayu.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026112414470419.webp\" alt=\"\">\n\n\n<img width=\"1500\" height=\"1125\" src=\"https://yayu.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026112414470541.webp\" alt=\"\">\n<img width=\"1500\" height=\"1125\" src=\"https://yayu.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/202611241447056.webp\" alt=\"\">\n<img width=\"1500\" height=\"1125\" src=\"https://yayu.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026112414470517.webp\" alt=\"\">\n<img width=\"1500\" height=\"1125\" src=\"https://yayu.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026112414470657.webp\" alt=\"\">\n\n\n<img width=\"1500\" height=\"1125\" src=\"https://yayu.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026112414470675.webp\" alt=\"\">\n<img width=\"1500\" height=\"1125\" src=\"https://yayu.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026112414470790.webp\" alt=\"\">\n<img width=\"1500\" height=\"1125\" src=\"https://yayu.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/202611241447078.webp\" alt=\"\">\n<img width=\"1500